    <!--
      Filled glyph icons (24x24 viewbox), sourced from Microsoft's open source
      Fluent UI System Icons (MIT licensed, github.com/microsoft/fluentui-system-icons)
      to match the actual Segoe MDL2 Assets glyphs the WPF app uses (Fluent System
      Icons is the modern, cross-platform continuation of that same icon family,
      same shapes, same "regular" weight). Render via:
        <Path Data="{StaticResource IconBackup}" Fill="..." Width="40" Height="40" Stretch="Uniform"/>
      These are single filled paths (nonzero winding cuts the holes), not strokes;
      do not add Stroke/StrokeThickness, it will look wrong.
    -->

